From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 04:50:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Campaign analytics UI: paginated History, Campaign Report,
 cumulative Dashboard

- History: paginated campaign table (Sent/Delivered/Shown/Opened/Dismissed per campaign), click a row to open its report
- /history/[id]: Campaign Report with stat cards, delivery funnel, Performance by App and Open Rate donut, live-polling
- Dashboard replaced with the same layout showing cumulative stats across all campaigns (+ /api/analytics/overview)
- GET /api/messages: server-side pagination (?page&pageSize) with per-campaign event stats; unpaged calls unchanged
- Allow Android apps to POST /api/analytics/fcm/event without a login cookie (it validates label + target id)
- schema.sql: create analytics tables after message_targets so a fresh database can be set up
